mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">i</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">j</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">k</mi></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">c</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">a</mi></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">i</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">j</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">k</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">i</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">j</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">k</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">j</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">k</mi></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">d</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">a</mi></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">i</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">j</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">k</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">i</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">j</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">k</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">i</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">j</mi></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Now, to find the volume of the parallelepiped, we need to take the absolute value of the triple product of the above vectors.</p>\n<p>Computing the triple product, we have</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"206\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 36.825em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.4em;\"><mjx-mover><mjx